# Claude Code layer: what differs from the tool-neutral subagents/<name>.md for Claude Code.
# One line per setting: <agent> <key> <value>. Each becomes a frontmatter line
# `key: value` in the generated file. setup/subagents.sh applies it.
# model: opus, sonnet, haiku or a full Claude model id. tools: Claude Code tool names.

accessibility-tester model sonnet
accessibility-tester tools Read, Grep, Glob, Bash
andrew-voice-writer model opus
andrew-voice-writer tools Read, Write, Edit, Glob, Grep
architect-reviewer model opus
architect-reviewer tools Read, Grep, Glob, Bash
code-reviewer model opus
code-reviewer tools Read, Grep, Glob, Bash
